<h1 style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; font-size: 26px; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center">Submit Your Input on Capital Budget Priorities</h1>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Capital projects such as roads, sewers and water infrastructure, parks, fire stations, and much more are vital to our quality of life and local economy. However, these investments only do their highest good when they align with residents’ needs, which is why we need your input on the capital needs in your area commission. </p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">We are asking for <strong>three to five capital budget priorities from each area commission/neighborhood organization.</strong> This form requires the prioritization of these requests, with Request #1 being the highest priority.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">It is important to note that submission of priorities does not guarantee that the projects will receive funding. Many capital projects can take years to plan and implement and funding is limited each year. Capital budgets are submitted individually by the departments to our department of finance. Department priorities are either “funded” or “unfunded” based on finance’s management of the overall capital budget.</p>
<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;"><tr><td align="center"><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScHXxYOGqdkd4jSWDizW4eJG34QEHX9lu5hY0BdHQ2WQY52OQ/viewform?usp=header&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;"><img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2025/07/11964973/surveyasset-6_original.png" style="width: 156px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="Red button: Text says Survey" width="156" height="39"></a></td></tr></table>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Please complete this survey by <strong>July 25, 2025</strong>.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">If you have any questions, please email <a href="mailto:officeofthemayor@columbus.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">officeofthemayor@columbus.gov</a>.</p>
